      "A": "Adjusted D/E = 2.10. Pacific violates the 1.75 covenant. Capitalization adds $72M to debt (total $252M) without increasing equity ($120M). The adjusted D/E of $252M/$120M = 2.10 exceeds the 1.75 ceiling by 20%.",
