    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-325-dupont-analysis-roe-drivers",
    "Stem": "Flash Holdings is decomposing the change in return on equity using the DuPont formula and Priya Ramaswamy, Senior analyst, is advising the board. Prior year ROE was 13.5%. Current year data: net profit margin 6.8%, asset turnover 1.40, equity multiplier 1.75. Prior year data: net profit margin 5.8%, asset turnover 1.30, equity multiplier 1.79. What is current ROE and the primary driver of the change versus prior year?",
