    "Stem": "Flash Ventures Omar Hassan, Senior analyst, and Grace Liu, Board member, must diagnose why ROE exceeds industry and whether growth is sustainable. Flash Ventures reports net income $620,000, sales $6,200,000, average total assets $5,600,000, average equity $2,800,000, industry ROE 15.0%, net margin 8.0%, asset turnover 1.20 x, equity multiplier 1.56 x. The pair must decompose DuPont and weigh whether leverage or efficiency drives outperformance before approving a debt-funded buyback for Flash Ventures. Which evaluation correctly decomposes and recommends?",
