    "ExplanationWrongB": "Choice D (24 days) reaches $1,800,000 / $75,000 by adding a non-defensive item to the asset base, most plausibly inventory carried at $450,000 or prepaid expenses. Inventory and prepaids are excluded from the defensive interval because they are not immediately convertible to cash; including them overstates Flash's resilience.",
