    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-420-fixed-charge-coverage",
    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, Flash Manufacturing's credit analyst, is evaluating Flash's debt-service capacity for a lending committee. Flash has earnings before interest and taxes of $2,400,000, interest expense of $400,000, and required operating lease payments of $600,000 that are fixed contractual charges. What is Flash's fixed charge coverage ratio?",
