    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-422-operating-financial-leverage-risk",
    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, Flash Manufacturing's CFO, is briefing the board on the company's risk profile. Flash has a high proportion of fixed production costs (high operating leverage) and a debt-to-equity ratio of 1.8 (high financial leverage). Sales have been volatile, swinging ±20% year to year. Which statement best characterizes the combined effect of these two leverage positions on Flash's earnings?",
