    "Part2OnlyFlag": true,
    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-425-inventory-turnover-average",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, Flash Manufacturing's segment analyst, is computing inventory turnover for the annual performance review. Flash's cost of goods sold for the year was $6,000,000. Beginning inventory was $1,200,000 and ending inventory was $1,800,000. What is Flash's inventory turnover?",
