    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, Flash Manufacturing's credit analyst, is evaluating the company's receivables collection efficiency. Flash's net credit sales for the year were $9,000,000. Beginning accounts receivable (net) were $1,500,000 and ending accounts receivable (net) were $2,500,000. What is Flash's accounts receivable turnover?",
