    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-443-common-size-statement",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy is preparing a common-size income statement for Flash Manufacturing to compare against the industry. Flash's net sales are $10,000,000, cost of goods sold is $6,500,000, operating expenses are $2,000,000, and net income is $900,000. What is Flash's net profit margin on a common-size basis?",
