    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-456-take-or-pay-contract",
    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah is reviewing Flash Manufacturing's purchase commitments for the debt covenant report. Flash has a take-or-pay contract requiring it to purchase $5,000,000 of raw materials annually for the next four years, regardless of whether Flash needs the materials. Which statement best describes the treatment and analysis of this commitment?",
