    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy is analyzing why Flash Manufacturing's return on equity declined from 18% to 14.4% despite stable sales. Flash's net profit margin held at 6%, asset turnover held at 2.0, but the equity multiplier fell from 1.5 to 1.2. What explains the ROE decline?",
