    "UniqueConceptKey": "A-483-operating-leverage-effect",
    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah is evaluating Flash Manufacturing's operating leverage. Flash's contribution margin is $5,000,000 and its fixed operating costs are $2,000,000. What is Flash's degree of operating leverage at the current sales level?",
