    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy is reviewing Flash Manufacturing's segment disclosures for the earnings analysis. Flash has three reportable segments: Consumer Products (revenue $50,000,000), Industrial Components (revenue $30,000,000), and Corporate/Other (revenue $20,000,000). Total revenue is $100,000,000. Under ASC 280, which segments must be reported separately?",
