    "Stem": "Maya Caldwell is reviewing Flash Manufacturing's related-party transactions for the annual report. Flash sold inventory to a company whose CEO is the brother of Flash's CFO, Adaeze Onuorah. The transaction was at arm's-length prices. Which statement best describes the required treatment?",
